/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   07 / Terminal — command workstation

   The menu is a process console, not a card collection: a command rail selects
   the operation, the coach occupies the main workspace, and level/session data
   lives in two inspectors. The game keeps the board as a right-hand viewport
   while coach I/O and match telemetry stack in the left command column.
