/* Flat Icon keeps the style control as a true left rail on phones. Reserve a
   narrow gutter for it instead of floating the 56px trigger above whichever
   setup card happens to sit at the viewport bottom. The adjacent picker stays
   a bottom sheet and therefore still has the full viewport width when open. */
